# The repository root .gitignore excludes "*.json" for Terraform/AWS artifacts.
# The dashboard's manifests and lockfile must stay tracked, so re-include JSON
# here. Directories excluded above (node_modules/, dist/) are not traversed by
# git, so this negation cannot accidentally re-add build output or dependencies.
!*.json
